# Settings that are private to your computer. To use them:
#   1. copy this file and call the copy  .env   (git ignores .env, so it never reaches GitHub)
#   2. fill in the values
#   3. run  docker compose up -d
#
# Automatic check of comments by OpenAI's Moderation API (see "Comments" in README.md).
# Leave both lines as they are to keep it off.
PULSE_COMMENT_CLASSIFIER=
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# To switch it on:
# PULSE_COMMENT_CLASSIFIER=pulse.moderation.openai_classifier
# OPENAI_API_KEY=paste-your-key-here
